# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Claude Design export bundles. The individual images are the deliverable;
# the zip is a 5MB duplicate of them and this repo is public.
*.zip

# Editor / scratch
*.tmp
*~

# LinkedIn carousel source pages. These build the PDFs and the covers, then nothing
# consumes them: Content Sync only scans files sitting directly in linkedin/ and the
# publishers read URLs from the sheet, not from GitHub. Roughly 5MB a month in a public
# repo for files nothing reads. Kept on disk so a single page can be fixed or a PDF
# rebuilt without re-running Claude Design.
posts/*/linkedin/pages/
